name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q6_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'A student wants to create an "AI Credibility Guide" for younger students. Which piece of advice would be LEAST useful to include?'

wrong '"Check whether specific facts in the AI\'s response can be confirmed by a reliable outside source."'
right '"If the AI sounds confident and uses technical language, you can trust the response without checking it."'
wrong '"Look for signs the AI may have misunderstood your question, such as an answer that doesn\'t quite fit what you asked."'
wrong '"Slow down before sharing AI-generated content — ask yourself whether you have actually verified what it claims."'

allow_multiple_attempts true

